{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "main_6_level_main_06-01_end",
  "groupId": "main_6",
  "stageId": "main_06-01",
  "title": "Deadlock",
  "storyCode": "6-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "abb457600828866da49f32dcb8b4d8caf0e6f6ba80e8d4d55e8d02b2d85b6695",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Hah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Luckily I did some warm up back in Chernobog. But really, I didn't even break a sweat handling you guys."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "You! You Rhodes Islander, you're a disgrace to all Infected. How could you turn on your own like this just to help Lungmen?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "So you'll hand us over to them, as if that keeps your hands clean? Bullshit! How do you live with yourself?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "You ate two punches, cracked your skull on the pavement and you've still got the energy to talk trash? Not bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "But you've got it all wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Mmf!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Having trouble breathing? Feel like your lungs are on fire?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Ack... Guh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "It starts in your sinuses, then crawls down your windpipe, until it finally finds a home there in your diaphragm. All I have to do is wiggle my little finger and..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "A stream of superheated air will shoot into your body, expand, ignite your organs, and erupt out of your pores."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "The funny thing is, Lungmen might let you live. But me and my little finger...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Aah! Gaaah...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#9",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Won't leave any of you breathing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "Nooooo! L-let me go! Please!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Fine. I'll be merciful."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Officer! Over here. You take care of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "And one more thing, my new Ursus buddy. You think next time you could actually make me break a sweat?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Hey, they made it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Blaze",
      "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
      "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
      "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
      "text": "Dr. {@nickname}, over here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You were amazing!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "Hah. That was nothing."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#8",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "How about next time I show you how to snap an arm 90 degrees without breaking the bone?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "Hey, what's with that face...?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "How long have you been at Rhodes Island? You're acting like you've never seen a fight before."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "Compared to them, I'm a regular softie."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "You're certainly making a lot of noise.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "But of course. You think I'm the type to play it low-key?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "If I can put the fear of Blaze into them, who knows how many others might just give up."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Blaze",
              "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#4",
              "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
              "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
              "text": "I have to play it up to make all my hard work worth something."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Let's not steer the Doctor astray..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Bunny!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Don't just scoop me up like a toy!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "But you're just so soft...! Hey! Stop struggling! Just let it happen. I promise I won't bite!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Blaze... Stop... Can't... Breathe!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Phew."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We've only been apart for an hour! What's with you! Get serious!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#7",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "I take it back. You're not cute."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "That's enough...!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#10",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Woah, hey, I was just playing! Get out of my head! I can't take you screwing around with my emotions again!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Wait."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "She's here with you?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "Hello, I'm..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "I know who you are."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Talk to my fellow Infected like that again and I'll tear out your throat myself."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Blaze!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "Sorry, Amiya."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "But that's the way it is. And she deserves a warning."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Blaze",
          "speakerToken": "char_017_homura_3#5",
          "operatorId": "char_017_homura",
          "portraitKey": "char_017_homura",
          "text": "I'm out. Rendezvous at the next waypoint."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "GreyThroat, Blaze may have misunderstood you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "It's fine. I really did say those things."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "She shouldn't be dredging up your past to attack the person you are today."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "Who knows? Have I really changed? Even I don't know."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "......"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "You'll need to do something to find it out then.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Can we really have you running ops right now?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "GreyThroat",
          "speakerToken": "char_367_swllow_1",
          "operatorId": "char_367_swllow",
          "portraitKey": "char_367_swllow",
          "text": "I'm here because I wanted to do something. No matter what that Blaze says."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Sigh..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "(Amiya...)",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(Right... She's not Infected, so GreyThroat might not grasp the reality of Rhodes Island's current situation.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(This operation could force her to decide once and for all... if she's going to stay or leave.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(But she's gotten used to taking orders, and doesn't speak up much. Sometimes she does surprise, though...)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(There's no malice in her heart. She just needs a chance to find herself.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "(Still, she's strong and reliable. You can trust her, Doctor. And even if we can't help her, I know she can help you.)"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Oh... where did Gavial go?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Got too excited and went to crack some skulls?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Probably went to do frivolous collateral damage.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "She can't do that!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Wait a minute, who taught you to think of her like that, Doctor? I mean, it's kind of true, but still..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We can't afford to make mistakes here. Hurry to the next waypoint and try to signal her."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Even if she's operating according to plan, there'll be trouble if no one's watching her..."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What about the other teams?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We've got elite operators acting as squad leaders. They'll report in. Don't worry."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "We stand at a crucial point in this joint operation. This is the decisive battle for Lungmen."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What about Superintendent Ch'en?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "She has her own mission to command."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Superintendent Ch'en, as Chief of the Special Inspection Unit, will be deploying the best the L. G. D. has to offer against Reunion in service of our joint plan."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "At the same time, she has to herd Reunion's main force to the target location, all while keeping any of their smaller teams from slipping into the slums."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "And we, Rhodes Island, will keep moving through the waypoints on our patrol route, mopping up Reunion's squads along the way, pushing them to give up the fight."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Finally, we'll reach the target location at the slums and, together with the L. G. D., we'll deliver the decisive blow to Reunion's main force."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Considering the scale, there's relatively little Rhodes Island can do. But we'll execute the plan to the best of our abilities."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "As for the issues that have come up in the course of our cooperation with the L. G. D.... Dr. {@nickname}, I promise to answer all our people."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But, Doctor, there is something only you can do."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Leave it to me!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Heh, good."
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "But it's not the kind of thing you'll have to put so much effort into."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Now's not the time to clam up!"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "Are you waiting for me to say more?"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "You could at least tell me what you're thinking, Doctor...!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "Should I be taking this more seriously?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "No, that's okay!"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Amiya",
              "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
              "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
              "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
              "text": "This isn't the kind of thing you need to be so solemn about."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I'm going to call up Blaze and have her look after you. And for the little while until we meet up again, I need you to look after her too."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Me look after her? Have you seen me?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "I can protect an elite operator? News to me.",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Ugh... I'm not talking about like in battle! I mean look after her psychology."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "You know Rhodes Island has to fight the Infected sometimes."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Especially right now. Our cooperation with Lungmen has led to some friction."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Blaze is one of the elite operators we rely on for survival, yes, but her psychological state has an impact on her performance."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It is because she is so resolutely committed to our mission that her encounters with the Infected have the potential to influence her emotions."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Go on, Doctor. Treat it as an opportunity to learn what makes her tick."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Show your appreciation for her. Thank her for saving you back there. She'll eat it up!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Good idea!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "Is that really necessary?",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I believe in you, Doctor! Go get 'em!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Their main force is engaging our other teams!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "We will reach the target location ahead of Reunion and join the formation!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Tell them we need to eliminate all Reunion elements that have not joined up with their main force first."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Right. Got it!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Do what Superintendent Ch'en just said! Over and out!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "How long has it been since we fought together like this?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "I wouldn't say we're 'fighting together' now. It's more like we're 'co-belligerents.' How did you get back here anyway?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "I've got my own motor pool, of course. How else do you think I saved Rhodes Island? Now what's got your panties in a twist? I can tell you're upset."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Hm. Let me think."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "You need to think about it! Look at you looking for reasons to be mad..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Oh, right. You went behind my back to save Rhodes Island. You could have told me in private."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Was that embarrassing for you? Or you just don't like being kept in the dark?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Both."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#5",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Wowee... since when are you so direct? My old Officer Ch'en would talk herself in circles for hours..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#1",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Eyes forward!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "L. G. D. defender squad, shields up! Play it just like we have a million times before. And never forget, your brothers and sisters are right behind you! Stand firm!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Hold!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Crossbows, nock!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "They blocked this road too? Uh oh... there's nowhere to go! We're trapped!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_1",
          "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
          "text": "Relax, we can break them! With me!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Hold!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Guards, ready!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Reunion Member",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Overrun them!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "——Now!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Swire",
          "speakerToken": "char_308_swire_1#6",
          "operatorId": "char_308_swire",
          "portraitKey": "char_308_swire",
          "text": "Crossbows, first volley, fire!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Pikes up!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ch'en",
          "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
          "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
          "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
          "text": "Don't let a single one of them out of our city!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "Are you on site?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "Yes, that's right."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "I know. But the L. G. D. has their job to do and you have yours. Don't forget your role in all this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "Indeed. Lin Kojui is quite opposed."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "But this matter is beyond him!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "I've heard all the opinions from all the stakeholders. But there is no wiggle room here. I do what must be done."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "Kojui's daughter will reach out to you. In the next three weeks, you are not to contact me. Everything goes to her."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "I leave it to you. Don't worry. I am watching you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "...There's no need for that. The past is the past. And it stays in the past."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Wei Yenwu",
          "speakerToken": "char_2005_weiyw_1",
          "operatorId": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "portraitKey": "char_2005_weiyw",
          "text": "Right. To the peaceful and stable future of Lungmen."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Wei, old boy, we're brothers, of a sort, aren't we...?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "So I'm asking you, for the sake of my daughter and her mother..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Honestly, should I even have to ask? Would you really refuse to help your own sister?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "I've already decided on a name for my daughter. We'll call her..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...Talulah."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Don't take it to heart. I understand."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "It's all very clear to me."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
